<title>USA: America West January load factor 62.9 pct.</title>
<headline>America West January load factor 62.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>America West Airlines reported record January 1997 traffic at 1.2 billion revenue passenger miles, up 19.3 percent over the same month last year.</p>
<p>Capacity increased 21.6 percent to a record 2.0 billion available seat miles resulting in a passenger load factor of 62.9 percent versus 64.1 percent in January 1996.</p>
</text>
